# LaTeX build intermediates — regenerated on every compile. Keep only the
# source (main.tex, references.bib) and the camera-ready final_proposal.pdf.
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.xdv
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
# Raw compiler output (we commit final_proposal.pdf, not the working main.pdf)
main.pdf
# CJK font copied locally for the build (OFL Noto Serif SC, ~24 MB) — not committed.
# See README.md for the Overleaf alternative (load a Noto CJK font by name instead).
*.ttf
